    "### Data Preparation Summary\n",
    "\n",
    "At this stage, a working cleaned dataset has been created and exported. The preparation steps support reproducibility because the same cleaned file can be reused for analysis, modelling and reporting.\n",
    "\n",
    "The main preparation decisions were:\n",
    "\n",
    "- limiting the dataset to working-age individuals;\n",
    "- checking exact duplicate rows;\n",
    "- converting columns to appropriate numeric types;\n",
    "- reviewing missing values and categorical distributions;\n",
    "- saving a cleaned working version of the dataset.\n",
    "\n",
    "These steps reduce the risk of modelling errors and make the later audit process easier to explain."
   ]
