    "# 4. Exploratory Data Analysis\n",
    "\n",
    "The exploratory data analysis phase provides visual and descriptive evidence about the dataset before modelling. The purpose is not only to describe the data, but also to identify patterns that may later affect model performance and fairness interpretation.\n",
