    "# 5. Modelling Dataset Construction\n",
    "\n",
    "This section constructs the dataset used for supervised machine learning. The target variable is derived from the ESR employment status field and converted into a binary classification task.\n",
    "\n",
    "The modelling problem is defined as follows:\n",
    "\n",
    "- **Dependent variable / target:** `EMPLOYED`, where 1 represents employed and 0 represents not employed.\n",
    "- **Independent variables / features:** demographic and education-related variables retained after leakage prevention.\n",
    "\n",
    "This framing allows the notebook to simulate a recruitment-style decision support output and then audit that output for subgroup-level disparities."
