   "source": [
    "## Target Variable Definition\n",
    "\n",
    "The ESR field is transformed into a binary employment target. This is necessary because the selected modelling algorithms require a clearly defined outcome variable.\n",
    "\n",
    "The binary target is intentionally simple: the model predicts whether a person is employed or not employed. In the context of this project, this prediction is used only to generate auditable model outputs. It should not be interpreted as a real hiring recommendation.\n"
   ]
  },
  {
